.git
.github

# Build caches. .moon/cache/outputs alone is >1GB of task-output tarballs and was
# the whole reason every service build streamed hundreds of MB to the daemon.
.moon/cache
**/target
**/dist
**/coverage
**/node_modules
node_modules

# Python: virtualenvs are hundreds of MB and are rebuilt inside the image anyway.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Not part of any service build.
frontend
landing-page
documentation
simulators
k8s
grafana
keycloak
graphify-out
**/*.md

# Secrets and local state never belong in a build context.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
secrets
.claude
.zed
